{
  "rulesetVersion": 1,
  "note": "Shared conformance vectors. Every evaluator (TypeScript reference, C# in QuickCheck, Kotlin on the phone) must produce exactly these findings (id, severity, evidenceType, and the listed evidence values) for these inputs.",
